      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "مشرق از جهل کیش بودایی",
      "CoupletIndex": 17,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 19
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 36,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "شد به یغمای قوم صحرایی‌",
      "CoupletIndex": 17,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 19
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 37,
      "Position": "Right",
      "Text": "گاه شد عرضگاه لشکر هون‌",
      "CoupletIndex": 18,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 20
    },
    {
      "VOrder": 38,
      "Position": "Left",
      "Text": "گه ز هیتال ‌شد خراب و زبون",
      "CoupletIndex": 18,
      "SectionIndex1": 0,
      "SectionIndex2": 20
    },
    {
